\viewkind4\uc1\pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\tx600\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1
\par \ulnone\b0 Now thank we all our God,                                            \cf0 
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 With heart and hands and voices,                                          
\par Who wondrous things hath done,                                            
\par In whom His world rejoices;                                                  
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Who from our mothers' arms                                                 
\par Has blessed us on our way                                                     
\par With countless gifts of love,                                           
\par And still is ours today.   
\par                                                          
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Oh, may this bounteous God
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 through all our life be near us,
\par with ever-joyful hearts
\par and blessed peace to cheer us,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par and keep us in His grace,
\par and guide us when perplexed,
\par and free us from all ills
\par in this world and the next.    
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. All praise and thanks to God
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 who reigns in highest heaven -
\par the Father and the Son
\par and Spirit - now be given:
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par the one, eternal God,
\par whom earth and heaven adore;
\par for thus it was, is now,
\par and shall be evermore.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

